test/check/error-pattern-base.sumspec:19:73:
   |
19 | halted :: App => core.Core(core.Link.Down) * View.Busy -> View.Idle  >> core.stop
   |                                                                         ^
core.stop can't happen in any state this source matches: each of its sources picks other variants; fire it from a state where it can happen

test/check/error-pattern-base.sumspec:20:16:
   |
20 | stopClicked :: core.Ready => View.Busy -> View.Idle
   |                ^
core.Ready is a pattern, which goes where a pattern goes; a shared path is written with paths or a __path

test/check/error-pattern-base.sumspec:22:27:
   |
22 | linked :: App(View.Busy * core.Linked) -> App(View.Idle)
   |                           ^
pattern core.Linked takes 1 argument, but none is given

test/check/error-pattern-base.sumspec:23:41:
   |
23 | wrongArg :: App(View.Busy * core.Linked(View.Idle)) -> App(View.Idle)
   |                                         ^
View is not a factor of core.Core (core.Link * core.Mode)

test/check/error-pattern-base.sumspec:24:11:
   |
24 | inCore :: core.InCore => core.Link.Up -> core.Link.Down
   |           ^
test/check/base-patterns.sumspec declares no type InCore

